      "cancel": [],
      "conversion": "MixinExtras @WrapOperation on the two new ConsistentBitArray(13, 4096) of the RegionTexture constructor (one shared all-zero table), @ModifyExpressionValue on the heightValues / topHeightValues read in front of the set call of putHeight / putTopHeight (the texture gets its own table first; no allocation on the path), and @WrapOperation on readCacheData's setData calls on the two fields (ordinals 1, 3 and 4; own table from the read data); removeHeight / removeTopHeight run as shipped (0 over 0 on the shared table). Runtime flag xaeroworldmapLazyTileHeights (shadow .shadow). Helper bons.furious.patch.xaeroworldmap_c49.LazyHeights.",
